Tom: I''m thinking about the football club. It''s cheap, and you only need a ball.
Mia: That''s true. I''d rather try tai chi. My grandfather says it helps you relax.
Tom: Tai chi? Isn''t that just for old people?
Mia: Not at all. It''s slow, but it builds balance and calms your mind.
Tom: Maybe I''ll come and watch one day. When does your club meet?
Mia: Every morning before class, at seven o''clock.
Tom: Seven? That''s a bit early for me! I''ll stick with football in the afternoon.
Mia: That''s fine. The important thing is just to keep moving and stay active.', 'Mia 问 Tom 想加入哪个新社团;Tom 想加入足球社,因为便宜、只需一个球;Mia 更想试太极,爷爷说它能放松;Tom 觉得太极是老人的运动;Mia 说太极虽慢但能练平衡、让人心静;社团每天早上七点活动;Tom 嫌太早,选下午踢足球;Mia 说重要的是保持运动。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which club is Tom thinking of joining?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The football club.","The tai chi club.","The skating club.","The swimming club."]},{"q":"Why does Tom like that sport?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It is played indoors.","It is cheap and needs only a ball.","It needs special shoes.","It is only for adults."]},{"q":"What does Mia want to try?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Tai chi.","Football.","Running.","Tennis."]},{"q":"When does Mia''s club meet?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Late at night.","Early in the morning.","At lunchtime.","Only on weekends."]},{"q":"What does Mia think is most important?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Winning every game.","Buying good equipment.","Keeping moving and staying active.","Getting up late."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U3', 'fltrp');
Leah: I took a few classes back home in Britain, and I fell in love with it.
Journalist: And why did you choose to come to Yangshuo?
Leah: A great master of tai chi lives here, and the mountain views are beautiful.
Journalist: Has it been difficult to study here?
Leah: Yes. I had to learn some Chinese, practise the same movements again and again, and get up very early.
Journalist: So why do you keep going?
Leah: Because tai chi relaxes me and brings me a deep sense of balance.
Journalist: That sounds wonderful. Thank you, Leah.', '记者问 Leah 何时开始对太极感兴趣;Leah 说在英国上过几节课就爱上了;她选阳朔是因为这里住着一位太极大师、山景也美;在这里学习并不容易:要学些中文、反复练同样的动作、还要很早起床;她坚持下去是因为太极让她放松、带给她深深的平衡感;记者道谢。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where did Leah first try tai chi?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["In Britain.","In Yangshuo.","In America.","In Japan."]},{"q":"Why did she choose Yangshuo?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It is the biggest city in China.","A great master lives there and the views are beautiful.","Her whole family lives there.","It is the cheapest place to stay."]},{"q":"What is one difficulty she mentions?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Finding a good job.","Paying very high fees.","Having to learn some Chinese.","The very cold weather."]},{"q":"How often does she practise the same movements?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only once a month.","Only on weekends.","Almost never.","Again and again."]},{"q":"Why does she keep doing tai chi?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It relaxes her and gives her balance.","It makes her rich.","It is required by law.","Her boss told her to."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U3', 'fltrp');
Lucy: Basketball is fun, but I think we should recommend skipping.
Ken: Skipping? Why?
Lucy: Because it''s cheap, easy to learn, and great for the heart. Everyone can join in.
Ken: That''s a good point. Basketball needs a court and a proper ball.
Lucy: Exactly. With skipping, all you need is a rope, and you can even do it in the classroom.
Ken: All right. Let''s suggest both, and let the class choose.
Lucy: Perfect. The main thing is that everyone keeps active.', 'Ken 想为体育课推荐篮球,问 Lucy 的看法;Lucy 觉得篮球有趣,但更想推荐跳绳;因为跳绳便宜、易学、对心脏好,人人都能参加;Ken 承认篮球需要球场和合适的球;Lucy 说跳绳只需一根绳子,在教室里都能跳;Ken 提议两个都推荐,让全班来选;Lucy 同意,关键是让大家都动起来。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which sport does Ken recommend first?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Skipping.","Football.","Basketball.","Swimming."]},{"q":"Which sport does Lucy prefer to suggest?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Basketball.","Tennis.","Running.","Skipping."]},{"q":"Why does Lucy like that sport?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It is cheap, easy and good for the heart.","It needs a big court.","It is only for tall people.","It costs a lot of money."]},{"q":"What does basketball need, according to Ken?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Only a single rope.","A court and a proper ball.","A swimming pool.","Special shoes only."]},{"q":"What do they finally decide?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["To choose basketball only.","To cancel the PE class.","To suggest both and let the class choose.","To play neither sport."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U3', 'fltrp');

